  calendar_event_canceler / calendar_event_updater seams
- services/calendar.py + services/conversation.py + services/tool_registry.py
  — wiring + tool registry additions
- prompts/scheduling_bot.md — confirmation-flow prompt updates
- tests/services/test_{conversation,scheduling,tool_registry}.py — 16 new tests;
  7 failing in TestServiceCancelAppointment + TestServiceRescheduleAppointment

