/ 7 fail (all in the new cancel+reschedule test classes — DDD was debugging
when watchdog fired).

DDD2 task: fetch this branch, copy the 10 files into a fresh worktree, fix
the 7 failing tests, close Phase 9.

NOT FF-merged to main — finisher takes over from this commit.

